---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
title: "Think by Numbers"
description: "Suboptimal governance costs each of us about $12,625 a year. An essay in numbers on why our governments have no thermostat, the loop being built to give them one, and the world on the other side."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
